  <FLAVOURTEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="en-US"><![CDATA[Lungs dried to parchment wheeze blasphemies within a cage of bleached bone.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="fr-FR"><![CDATA[Des poumons desséchés comme du parchemin qui sifflent des blasphèmes dans une cage thoracique d'os blanchis.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="es-ES"><![CDATA[Los pulmones resecados susurran blasfemias dentro de un tórax de huesos blanqueados.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="de-DE"><![CDATA[Zu Pergament getrocknete Lungen in ausgebleichten Brustkästen wispern Gotteslästerungen.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="it-IT"><![CDATA[I polmoni essiccati e incartapecoriti fischiano empietà in una gabbia di ossa sbiancate.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="jp-JA"><![CDATA[白い骨の檻の中で羊皮紙のように乾ききった肺は、喘ぐような音で冒涜を口にする。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ko-KR"><![CDATA[앙상한 갈빗대 사이에 있는 말라비틀어진 폐에서 계속 저주가 흘러나온다.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ru-RU"><![CDATA[Иссохшие лоскуты его легких со свистом изрыгают проклятия в клетке побелевших от времени костей.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="pt-BR"><![CDATA[Pulmões tão desidratados que viraram pergaminho murmuram blasfêmias dentro de uma gaiola de ossos esbranquiçados.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-CN"><![CDATA[肺部风干成白骨笼中喘响的羊皮纸。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-HK"><![CDATA[肺部風乾成白骨籠中喘響的羊皮紙。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
  </FLAVOURTEXT>
